WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
My friend urgently needs help.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
His name is Egor,
and he has just turned 18.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
He grew up very happily, in a close family
with a mum, a dad,

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.300
two daughters — and him, the long-awaited son.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:19.900
He lived an ordinary teenage life: lots of
hobbies, many friends, and he did well at school.

6
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.000
He was my classmate.

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.300
But in 2024 Egor was diagnosed
with myelodysplastic syndrome.

8
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.000
After that the family travelled
to St Petersburg for a transplant.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
But the illness would not retreat —
it turned out to be very treacherous.

10
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.900
He was diagnosed with
myeloblastic leukaemia with a mutation.

11
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.100
Despite many rounds of chemotherapy
and a bone marrow transplant from his father,

12
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.900
there was no result —
and Egor relapsed.

13
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:53.000
In the end Egor was referred to the Dmitry
Rogachev Center for Pediatric Oncology.

14
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.800
He travelled from St Petersburg to Moscow
by ambulance, for CAR-T therapy.

15
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.500
But that method did not help at all.

16
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Yet neither Egor's family nor Egor himself
were going to give up.

17
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:11.900
They began searching for help abroad — protocols
and medicines that could save him.

18
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:19.900
Egor's family is asking you for help,
because your help is a chance at a future —

19
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:21.000
a future in which he can live
without pain and suffering.

20
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
I'll leave the payment details in the
description, where you can send help for Egor,

21
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.900
so that he can fly abroad
for treatment very soon.

22
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:35.600
I want to urge you
to share this post.

23
00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:44.000
Because Egor is only 18, and a big,
happy future lies ahead of him —

24
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.000
one he is longing for,
and one his family wishes for him.

25
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:56.300
Please don't scroll past — share this
and help save his life.
